<article class="prose-view">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Questions, wrong information (like a station exit), or something that doesn't work, including accessibility problems: we'd like to hear about it.</p>
{{#if email}}
    <p class="contact-email">{{icon "envelope" "me-2"}}{{t "contact.email"}} <a href="mailto:{{email}}">{{email}}</a></p>
{{/if}}
    <p>You can also <a href="https://github.com/adiamandouros/move/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">report a problem on GitHub <span class="sr-only">{{t "shell.new-tab"}}</span></a>.</p>

    <h2>Not about Wayhop?</h2>
    <p>Wayhop isn't part of OASA. For lost property, tickets, refunds or complaints about a service, contact <a href="https://www.oasa.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OASA <span class="sr-only">{{t "shell.new-tab"}}</span></a> or <a href="https://www.stasy.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">STASY <span class="sr-only">{{t "shell.new-tab"}}</span></a>.</p>
</article>
